      "html": "<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n  <a href=\"/countries/hong-kong/salaries-tax/salaries-tax-calculator/\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary\">\n    <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary\">Hong Kong Salaries Tax Calculator</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Estimate personal income tax liability with all allowances and domestic rental deductions factored in.</p>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/countries/hong-kong/stamp-duty/hk-property-stamp-duty-calculator/\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary\">\n    <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary\">HK Property Stamp Duty Calculator</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Calculate Scale 2 AVD stamp duty on residential property purchases in Hong Kong.</p>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/countries/hong-kong/salaries-tax/hk-net-salary-calculator/\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary\">\n    <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary\">Hong Kong Net Salary Calculator</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Calculate exact monthly take-home pay after MPF contributions and IRD tax holdbacks.</p>\n  </a>\n</div>"
