      "html": "<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n  <a href=\"/blogs/hong-kong-property-tax-guide/\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary\">Rental Income Tax</span>\n    <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary mt-1\">Hong Kong Property Tax &amp; Rental Guide</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Comprehensive breakdown of 15% property tax on rental income, 20% statutory deductions, and landlord returns.</p>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/blogs/hong-kong-rental-reimbursement-scheme-guide/\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\">Housing Benefit</span>\n    <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary mt-1\">Rental Reimbursement Scheme Guide</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">How structuring salary as housing reimbursement taxes only 10% rental value instead of full income.</p>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/blogs/hong-kong-tenancy-agreement-rental-stamp-duty-guide/\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400\">Lease Stamping</span>\n    <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary mt-1\">Tenancy Agreement Stamping Guide</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Official IRD stamp duty rates for residential leases and step-by-step e-Stamping procedures.</p>\n  </a>\n</div>"
